<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - American Pad &amp; Paper.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - American Pad &amp; Paper.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said it downgraded American Pad &amp; Paper Co to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- the stock was off 1/4 to 16-7/8.</p>
</text>
